{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_title", "source_sha256": "fb765fe115aa7b7d060d596a3a037cad0defa39c21cdfe6f9a8b87a5926bfb34", "ja": "だって、大好きだから！", "zh": "因为是我的最爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a3286a20bc2be48382980ce573ef6b0ed56194054653d38eb92a918f88fe4fe6", "ja": "公演に向けてジュリア、志保と共にレッスン\nに励む可奈。可奈がセンターを務めることに\n納得できない志保は、厳しい言葉で可奈の未\n熟さを指摘するが、可奈はむしろ志保に感謝\nしてレッスンを重ね、公演を成功させる。", "zh": "为了公演，可奈和茱莉亚、志保一同专心在\n训练课程上。无法认同可奈担任Center的\n志保严厉指出可奈的不足之处，\n但可奈反而感谢志保，并透过不断的训练，\n让公演圆满成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "254ff1db7d9c5d3acb218e37761c36d45a8eef06c335dc6eee55b44b5835fa68", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん！\n私のステージ、どうでした！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！\n我的表演怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dfde460e6ab97eb01d071f1c6f1bed08106fc0784fee943810ebcaa58e3d77a0", "ja": "待て待て、まだお客さんの手拍子が鳴ってるだろ？\nアンコールの準備をしないと！", "zh": "先等等，观众还在鼓掌吧。\n要准备安可才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "43ee58c96f4ad3dcbcc30decdf8169389e0091196ce028fbd3bacf70a3f23ad8", "ja": "はれっ！？　そ、そうでした！\nじゃあ、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "咦！？对、对喔！\n那我回去台上了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6a081fef8637735e92eb1716fab829700f6d0363fb9a179234091182a0af37fe", "ja": "あっ、まだそのタイミングじゃ……！", "zh": "啊，现在还不是回台上的时候啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1004_null", "source_sha256": "a57d13b62fc6c1cc1c2241e7824835909ba0b005abcdc97b122481a0bfd2900f", "ja": "アンコール後……", "zh": "安可结束以后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "a4763a5d71ca63f55470cf79385423ff65e70c653c74f8f801304aa4416da78c", "ja": "お疲れ様でーす！　ライブが終わったあとも、\nたくさん歌わせてもらっちゃった♪　うれしいな～♪", "zh": "大家辛苦了～！演唱会结束以后，\n还唱了这么多首歌呢♪好开心喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "6b5b1ff5bff5274cc57f81bcb1b24f86c956a551fdf223f755a624ddf21155e7", "ja": "みんな、最後まで帰ろうとしなかったもんな。\nホント、いいライブだったよ。な、シホ！", "zh": "观众直到最后都还舍不得回去呢。\n真的是一场很棒的演唱会。你说是吧，志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "bbdf872b0d7101691e7322ba28043d9c405fa5d758db4d2f8321bfc34315f3a2", "ja": "…………。\nあ、そう、ですね。", "zh": "…………\n啊，嗯，对啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "d7bc6bae6f7f0e5a5325e8618d765682488bedff58f2398e9a77c8cfbba42c6b", "ja": "私、ステージで歌ってるだけなのに、なんだか……\nお客さんとお喋りしてるみたいだったかもっ。", "zh": "我明明只是在舞台上唱歌，却觉得……\n自己好像在跟观众聊天一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "acfccd54bedce5534fabb9eea063df4a102d81c5369851a5ecdf9265bad051c1", "ja": "あのっ、{$P$}さん！\n私、とってもウキウキで楽しかったです♪", "zh": "跟你说喔，{$P$}先生！\n我觉得演唱会好兴奋、好好玩喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b9e3d83a8ccb24e5b0568d369c372b0593ea14a17717c009e0f1a762d9ab260b", "ja": "ああ、俺もウキウキしながら見ていたよ。\nいいステージだったぞ！", "zh": "嗯，我在旁边看也觉得很激动。\n你们的演出很棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "a0ab6467188e7811ab4884a33a1eb13767e3f64b2651a882563ec2968f46995b", "ja": "やったー！　えへ、ありがとうございまーす♪", "zh": "耶～！嘿嘿，谢谢夸奖～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "b327f09f2b764eaf1eaf74fada963365fbbd56df74c8c80c48c862d946e8a40d", "ja": "あっ、志保ちゃんもありがとう！\n志保ちゃんのアドバイスのおかげで、上手に歌えたよ！", "zh": "啊，我也要谢谢志保！\n多亏有志保的建议，我才能把歌唱好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "1dc08624a7f9b014fe9bb149377719f109e7c72892e7af10df0541ff4e0a4785", "ja": "？　志保ちゃん？", "zh": "嗯？志保？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "eba50efc3c0152fbea968c38aa4199625cc86d6285a3da4922cb55b816511318", "ja": "ううん、なんでも。\n役に立ったのなら良かったわ。", "zh": "不，没事。\n有帮上忙就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "5d3b6df51a56bcc2e2b22f874a6fe673f1922556a56c1b5d449b8f21f7ee131e", "ja": "ジュリアさんも！　いっぱい教えてくれたり、\n励ましてくれたり……うれしかったです！　えへ♪", "zh": "还有茱莉亚！你不仅教了我很多，\n还一直鼓励我……人家好开心喔！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "d388d2a6bf97b103b43b25e90696add38d3e54c18a7817b7817718601e1b0751", "ja": "あはは。最初はそのつもりだったんだけど……\nどうも、逆だったみたいだな。", "zh": "啊哈哈，我一开始确实是打算来帮忙的……\n不过，结果好像相反呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "053ae917d74137d85cafb57b43538c038903213c9d82ce789e40cda6cd61cbc8", "ja": "はい？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "e867ab639f883d0d8d150398170f089844be33e794350a16b415f9bbaecc46f7", "ja": "ウチらの方が、可奈に教えられて、\n励まされたってことだよ！", "zh": "意思是，我们才是从可奈身上学到不少东西、\n被可奈鼓励的人啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "5d8b1d25fef364e2c230dfcee0c2c5afa331054cc70a542e26f62a767eb21f41", "ja": "{$P$}。あんた、もしかして\nそこまで見通して、可奈をセンターに？", "zh": "{$P$}，你该不会\n就是料到了这点，才让可奈当Center的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1022_p", "source_sha256": "07fe22eda24ef2f8a4a4eb385e26844bf311a2e86114b606f3d203fff29ade54", "ja": "どうかな？\nまあ、理由はいろいろだよ。", "zh": "谁知道呢，\n总之我这么做的原因有很多啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "cd8cbf65b4038e04e4da6b0d576b2810a9d5f8fa5b4f4716ba7ab2fc30f230ed", "ja": "ふふっ、なるほど。ま、いいけどね！", "zh": "呵呵，这样啊。也罢，怎样都好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "9823fdb4fbb424576b3420afdd0d5d6f67cadca3e708f6da98e3db95a27969b5", "ja": "あの～。……何の話ですか？", "zh": "那个～你们在讲什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "c6295b2a4457a668f11cd1655a823d768d1052ef98d21bd4a4d8e0c91cdd9e8c", "ja": "いいのいいの、こっちの話！　それより可奈、\nさっきのライブで、思いついたんだけど……。", "zh": "别在意别在意，跟你没关系！\n是说可奈，我在刚刚的演唱会上想到一件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "5df9a5acbe4b04c301abb1686d5a554d53d5a40f08baef5eee57334bbf59638d", "ja": "ウチらのバンド、志保もメンバーに入れないか？", "zh": "我们要组的乐团，要不要也邀请志保一起加入？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "a066965daedc44e87f982bbe5cf833db089c9dc43c9775d316e608f7af5a02e5", "ja": "わぁ、いいですねっ！\n志保ちゃん、今度は一緒にバンドやろうよ～！", "zh": "哇，这点子真棒！\n志保，接下来我们一起玩乐团吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1028_033sih", "source_sha256": "457dd5fd57fc3dd81e4722008906fc87966998649a62a8f7aae87fd295b6ca1e", "ja": "な、なに言ってるの？　どうして私が……。", "zh": "你、你在说什么？为什么我要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "39f0e30ff82e4f7a1d0c831977311270ec1d1d67b5ada2eeaaf5c8c5e15576ae", "ja": "センターの座は、可奈に先を越されたからな。\nシホ、バンドのボーカルの座を奪うってのはどうだ？", "zh": "因为Center的位置被可奈抢先了，\n志保，接着换你抢走乐团主唱的位置怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "cd3a0dbdcf46b340e1ea3bd1210d236dec30caf3a6c456a26d98e104b69752d7", "ja": "ええっ、そんな！？　あの、べ、ベースとかどうかな、\n志保ちゃん？　……あれ、ベースってなんだっけ？", "zh": "咦咦！怎么这样！？那个，志保，你、你弹贝斯如何？\n……咦，贝斯是什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1031_p", "source_sha256": "87f5813bef84e95ce58ae7905aba83d8dba74385a9f3100fafca208dfcd98e82", "ja": "それより、早く着替えないと、汗が冷えて風邪ひくぞ。\n続きは打ち上げでやろうか、みんな。", "zh": "先别聊了，流了满身汗，不赶快换衣服会着凉感冒的。\n各位，剩下的等庆功时再继续讲吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "6900a532c6b6f2ed73811ff005e67cd841ec3a3eb0b6829d53f080931db22837", "ja": "はーい！　ジュリアさん志保ちゃん、早く行こっ？\nうっれしいな～♪　みんなで打ち上げ～♪", "zh": "好～！茱莉亚、志保，我们快去换吧！\n好开心喔～♪大家一起庆功～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "8052c7be5c44a4056f94cfc261216ab2fdc217bc91a2fe779fc27531cc3f0115", "ja": "ははっ、やれやれ。ぐいぐい引っ張ってくれちゃって。\nさすがセンター、ってとこか！", "zh": "哈哈，真受不了。一直拉着我们到处跑，\n该说不愧是Center吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "7343e769c692e464fe58df1b480d5168ee79555911466f1b7dad3a228b9b6a2a", "ja": "…………。\n次は、負けませんから。", "zh": "…………\n下次，我不会输的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "f1c9e0420785a2fdc6fbb759d925c25a00f7df6b3fba5f0e8395c9cb3774e45f", "ja": "おっ、バンドに参戦決定か？", "zh": "喔？你这是确定要加入乐团了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1036_033sih", "source_sha256": "8f55836a0f7263f8d5445284236724fa679db1e9793da1b852145dd82a752e90", "ja": "その話じゃありません。", "zh": "我才不是这个意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "6c79dd4def817d7753c6f3393a000593626bfa0fe625a9436eefc4a9198fd345", "ja": "ふふっ、いいね、ああいうの。\nさ、あたし達もいこうぜ！", "zh": "呵呵，这样也不错。\n来，我们也快跟上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1038_p", "source_sha256": "52b2ad3d688c76914d2b2da1f4c0e84aa4029393d7e7aa0bb3e8051d7579262d", "ja": "（センターにとって必要な才能は、\n周りを引っ張ることだけじゃない）", "zh": "（担任Center要有的天分，\n不只是影响周遭而已。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_014_1039_p", "source_sha256": "ebc77470be2db2964ae9f00ed7bb89c4d837d9ff471f64a305bf1182666060b9", "ja": "（むしろ、周りを盛り上げ、巻き込んでいく力……。\n可奈の今後の成長に期待だな！）", "zh": "（还要有激励、带动周围伙伴的能力……\n真让人期待可奈未来的成长！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
